    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Assumptions (JAW-9917)\n- Webhook: POST **/intake-brief**, body `{ briefId, content }`; **Monday.com webhook secret** via n8n Header Auth on the Webhook node (shared secret header configured in the credential).\n- Valid brief: non-empty `briefId` and `content`, and `content.trim().length >= 5` (test payload passes).\n- Invalid shape: missing/empty fields → logged and ignored (no gap, no planning).\n- Failed validation (too-short content): POST **/v1/intake/gap-messages** via MPA.\n- Success: POST **/v1/intake/planning-run** then **Execute Workflow → Planning Workflow** with `requestId=briefId`, `qaResult=Pass`.\n- Duplicates: `briefId` in workflow global static data.\n- MPA validation audit: POST **/v1/intake/validate-brief** with `{ briefId, content, valid, gaps }` before branching.\n- Failures: POST **/v1/intake/team-alert** (`team: intake`, email). Processing HTTP nodes: 2 retries, 30s apart.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "f1e2d3c4-b5a6-9780-1234-567890abcdef",
      "name": "Assumptions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        -80
      ]
    },
